\par i) K\u7871\'3f to\'e1n c\'e1c nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7909\'3f kh\'e1c:
\par T\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7909\'3f c\'f2n l\u7841\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af52\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f52\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 i ch\'fda ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
