\par K\u7871\'3f to\'e1n chi ti\u7871\'3ft c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi thu ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f (t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn 76) v\'e0 c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n b\u7891\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af52\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f52\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 i th\'fd}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 \u7901\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft (t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af52\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f52\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 n 75) \'f0\'fd}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 \u7907\'3fc ph\u7843\'3fn \u7843\'3fnh trong 2 b\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af52\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f52\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 ng k\'ea sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 - B\u7843\'3fng k\'ea s\u7889\'3f 12, theo d\'f5i t\'ecnh h\'ecnh thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi c\'f4ng nh\'e2n, vi\'ean ch\u7913\'3fc nh\u7853\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af52\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f52\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 n l\'fd\'f5ng khi ph\'e1t l\'fd\'f5ng (ti}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 \u7875\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn 76.1)
\par - B\u7843\'3fng k\'ea s\u7889\'3f 13, theo d\'f5i thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi thu, ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f (ti\u7875\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn 76.2) v\'e0 c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n b\u7891\'3fi th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af52\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f52\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 \'fd}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15469507\charrsid16285195 \u7901\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft (t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn 75).
\par Nh\u7853\'3ft k\'fd ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f s\u7889\'3f 1 v\'e0 b\u7843\'3fng k\'ea s\u7889\'3f 12, s\u7889\'3f 13 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft cho c\'e1c ng\'e0nh theo m\u7851\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
